<title>LEBANON: Solidere mixed on Beirut Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>Solidere mixed on Beirut Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on Tuesday as A shares fell slightly to $114.75 from $115 and B shares were unchanged at $117.875.</p>
<p>Turnover was 17,964 shares from Monday's 19,173 and value was $2,082,277.25 from $2,217,880.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the four other companies listed on the Beirut Stock Exchange: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit, and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index fell 0.03 percent to 83.68 and the BLOM stock index fell 0.08 percent to 979.32.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
